an class=\"\">EN</span></button><button aria-label=\"Смени темата\" class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-muted-fg hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"hidden sm:block\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none active:scale-[0.98] border border-input bg-transparent hover:bg-muted h-9 px-3 text-sm\">Вход</button></a><button class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Меню\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-emerald-950\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;/images/received.webp&quot;); background-size: cover; background-position: center center;\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/55 via-slate-950/25 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-28 bg-gradient-to-t from-background to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"container py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-xl rounded-3xl bg-slate-950/55 p-6 ring-1 ring-white/10 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-store h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7\"></path><path d=\"M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h20\"></path><path d=\"M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7\"></path></svg> Манчестър · Eccles</span></div><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl\">Не превозваме просто пратки. Превозваме доверие.</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-white/85\">Понякога една пратка е много повече от кашон. В нея има подарък за дете, домашно приготвени неща за близките, важни документи или просто частица от дома, която трябва да стигне навреме.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container py-16 md:py-24 !py-12\"><div class=\"grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-3\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl\">Защо го правим</h2><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-fg\"><p>Именно това ни вдъхнови да създадем Доставки Хубенов — услуга, изградена върху доверие, коректност и лично отношение към всеки клиент. За нас всяка пратка има своя история и своя получател, който я очаква.</p><p>Затова работим така, както бихме искали някой да се погрижи за нашите собствени вещи — внимателно, отговорно и с уважение. Вярваме, че качествената услуга не се измерва само с това колко бързо ще пристигне една пратка, а с увереността, че тя е в сигурни ръце през целия път.</p><p>Всеки ден се стремим да оправдаваме доверието, което клиентите ни гласуват. То е причината да се развиваме и да ставаме все по-добри. Защото за нас това не са просто пратки — превозваме доверие.</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft\"><img src=\"/images/van-loading.webp\" alt=\"Товарене на буса с колети\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover\"><div class=\"space-y-4 p-6\"><div><p class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold text-foreground\">Доставки Хубенов</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-fg\">4 офиса за приемане на пратки</p></div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-700\">Заповядайте при нас</p><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-fg\">Главен склад</p><p class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">542 Liverpool Road, Eccles, Manchester, M30 7JA</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><div><p class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-fg\">Телефон</p><a href=\"tel:07895909915\" class=\"text-sm text-foreground hover:text-brand\">07895 909915</a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> Бус за България — всеки петък</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-border bg-muted/40\"><div class=\"container py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand text-brand-fg shadow-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-6 w-6\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\">В какво вярваме</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-muted-fg\">Малки неща, които правят голямата разлика, когато пращате към най-близките си.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground\">Собствен транспорт</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Ние возим до България. Колетът ви е в наши ръце по целия път — без чужди подизпълнители.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-clock h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M3 10h5\"></path><path d=\"M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground\">Курс всеки петък</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Редовен график, на който можете да разчитате. Знаете точно кога тръгва пратката ви.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-handshake h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9a2.82 2.82 0 0 1 3.79 0l2.96 2.66\"></path><path d=\"m18 15-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m15 18-2-2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground\">Семейна грижа</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Третираме подаръците и личните пратки така, както бихме третирали своите собствени.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 